    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa3 Casual Fishing</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0a Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual Fishing is a relaxing desktop idle game combining fishing simulation, codex collection, random item drops, and gear enhancement. You can enable &quot;Easy Mode&quot; to shrink the game and place it in a corner of the screen\u2014perfect for fishing while working or studying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600070/extras/3249eb1535b1fbce2118ad0c51c41932.avif?t=1750729955\" width=354 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Compact Mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc1f Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different fishing gears to deal with various types of fish. For example, the Electric Gun is great for capturing groups of fish, while the Harpoon Gun is perfect for catching fast-moving fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600070/extras/e166cbeb221fbc0398c4c7b8ce2e9431.avif?t=1750729955\" width=496 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Interaction Area)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting entries in your codex unlocks achievements and special rewards. From time to time, a Golden Fish will appear. Catching it grants bait or powerful gear to speed up your progress and help you become a true fishing master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa3 Casual Fishing</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0a Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual Fishing is a relaxing desktop idle game combining fishing simulation, codex collection, random item drops, and gear enhancement. You can enable &quot;Easy Mode&quot; to shrink the game and place it in a corner of the screen\u2014perfect for fishing while working or studying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600070/extras/3249eb1535b1fbce2118ad0c51c41932.avif?t=1750729955\" width=354 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Compact Mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc1f Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different fishing gears to deal with various types of fish. For example, the Electric Gun is great for capturing groups of fish, while the Harpoon Gun is perfect for catching fast-moving fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600070/extras/e166cbeb221fbc0398c4c7b8ce2e9431.avif?t=1750729955\" width=496 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Interaction Area)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting entries in your codex unlocks achievements and special rewards. From time to time, a Golden Fish will appear. Catching it grants bait or powerful gear to speed up your progress and help you become a true fishing master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
